# Applies to the build context (repository root) when building with image/Dockerfile.
# Start by ignoring everything, then allow only what the build needs.
# The last matching rule wins, so the test files are excluded again at the end:
# tests are not needed to build the binary, and ignoring them keeps the layer
# cache stable when only tests change.
*
!go.mod
!cmd
cmd/*_test.go
